{"type":"text","timestamp":1791376200271,"sessionID":"ses_ee9a95b76ffeIsBjZ2o7I9aqUt","part":{"id":"prt_116578b4d001Sp2cpYoKU5aVtF","messageID":"msg_1165781e5001oq57l1Kz2S1oYe","sessionID":"ses_ee9a95b76ffeIsBjZ2o7I9aqUt","type":"text","text":"Task list written to `docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/tasks.md`.\n\n**Branch check:** the worktree's `.git` points at `feature/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category`, matching `brief.md`. No mismatch.\n\n**Root cause found (not a missing feature — a hardcoded value):**\n- `src/lib/components/libraries/links/LinkCreate.svelte` line 44 always sends `category_id: null`, ignoring the category currently being browsed.\n- The current selection is `LinkLibrary.activeFilter` (`null | number | 'favorite'`): `null` = All, `0` = Uncategorized, positive = category id, `'favorite'` = favourites.\n- `create()` → `load()` → `reapplyFilter()` already re-applies the active filter, so no extra refresh work is needed once the id is set.\n- Precedent exists: `Todos.quickCreate()` already inherits `category_id` from the active filter.\n\n**Tasks produced:**\n- **TASK-1 (low):** add a small `getActiveCategoryId()`-style helper to `LinkLibrary` (for testability, mirroring existing getters) and use it in `LinkCreate.onsubmit()` — positive id for a selected category, `null` for All/Uncategorized/favourites.\n- **TASK-2 (low):** regression tests in `tests/unit/stores/LibraryStores.test.ts` for every filter state.\n- **TASK-3 (low):** `npm run check` / `npm test` / `npm run lint` plus behavioural confirmation.\n\nI explicitly flagged one constraint for the developer: `SaveToLibraryButton.svelte` also calls `create()` and must keep saving links as uncategorized (it uses a separate `LinkLibrary` instance whose `activeFilter` is never set, so a store-method approach leaves it untouched). I also noted mobile has no category UI (`CategoryHeader` is `max-md:hidden`), so it's out of scope. I did not touch `brief.md`, `implementation.md`, or `verdict.md`.","time":{"start":1791376198477,"end":1791376200267}}}
