{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791376549499,"sessionID":"ses_ee9a33476ffek46vS2h4uJeqKA","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_epdbL2rky3ugMdKZkCNG0708","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/implementation.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/implementation.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Implementation: link library: with a category selected add to that category\n2: \n3: id: punishment\n4: developer: deepseek-v4-flash (developer)\n5: date: 2026-10-07\n6: \n7: ## Summary\n8: \n9: New links created while browsing a link-library category now inherit that\n10: category instead of always being saved as uncategorized. The mapping is:\n11: positive category id -> that id; `0` (Uncategorized), `null` (All) and\n12: `'favorite'` -> `null` (uncategorized), preserving the previous behaviour for\n13: those views. The change is a store-level getter plus swapping a hardcoded\n14: `null` in the create form, following the existing `Todos.quickCreate()`\n15: precedent.\n16: \n17: ## Changes\n18: \n19: TASK-1: Make a new link inherit the currently selected category.\n20: - `src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` — added\n21:   `getActiveCategoryId(): number | null`, returning `activeFilter` when it is\n22:   a positive number and `null` otherwise.\n23: - `src/lib/components/libraries/links/LinkCreate.svelte` — `onsubmit()` now\n24:   sends `category_id: library.getActiveCategoryId()` instead of a hardcoded\n25:   `null`.\n26: - No change to `LinkLibrary.create()`'s signature or the\n27:   `SaveToLibraryButton.svelte` caller, as required. That caller uses a\n28:   *separate* `LinkLibrary` instance created in `src/routes/feeds/+layout.svelte`\n29:   whose `activeFilter` is never set, so `getActiveCategoryId()` stays `null`\n30:   there and feed saves remain uncategorized.\n31: \n32: TASK-2: Add regression tests for the active-category mapping.\n33: - `tests/unit/stores/LibraryStores.test.ts` — added a `LinkLibrary` test\n34:   covering all filter states: positive id -> that id, `0` -> `null`,\n35:   `'favorite'` -> `null`, `null` (All) -> `null`.\n36: \n37: TASK-3: Verify the change end to end.\n38: - `npm run check` — 0 errors, 0 warnings.\n39: - `npx vitest run tests/unit/stores/LibraryStores.test.ts` — 29 passed.\n40: - `npm test` — 713/714 passed; the single failure is the pre-existing,\n41:   unrelated `StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes` in\n42:   `tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts` (untouched by this job).\n43: - `npm run build` — production build succeeded.\n44: - `npm run lint` — cannot pass on this branch for pre-existing reasons, see\n45:   Known issues.\n46: \n47: ## Known issues / follow-ups\n48: \n49: - `npm run lint` fails independently of this change: `prettier --check .`\n50:   flags 404 files repo-wide (formatting drift, including untouched lines in\n51:   `LinkCreate.svelte`), and `eslint` reports a pre-existing unused import\n52:   `CreateLinkCategoryRequest` in `src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` (line 6,\n53:   not touched by this job). These are pre-existing and out of scope.\n54: - No rendered/browser confirmation was possible: the SPA requires a running\n55:   solyto REST API (`http://localhost:8000`) and authentication, neither of\n56:   which is available in this environment. The behaviour is covered by the unit\n57:   tests instead.\n\n(End of file - total 57 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Implementation: link library: with a category selected add to that category\n\nid: punishment\ndeveloper: deepseek-v4-flash (developer)\ndate: 2026-10-07\n\n## Summary\n\nNew links created while browsing a link-library category now inherit that\ncategory instead of always being saved as uncategorized. The mapping is:\npositive category id -> that id; `0` (Uncategorized), `null` (All) and\n`'favorite'` -> `null` (uncategorized), preserving the previous behaviour for\nthose views. The change is a store-level getter plus swapping a hardcoded\n`null` in the create form, following the existing `Todos.quickCreate()`\nprecedent.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: Make a new link inherit the currently selected category.\n- `src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` — added","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/implementation.md","text":"# Implementation: link library: with a category selected add to that category\n\nid: punishment\ndeveloper: deepseek-v4-flash (developer)\ndate: 2026-10-07\n\n## Summary\n\nNew links created while browsing a link-library category now inherit that\ncategory instead of always being saved as uncategorized. The mapping is:\npositive category id -> that id; `0` (Uncategorized), `null` (All) and\n`'favorite'` -> `null` (uncategorized), preserving the previous behaviour for\nthose views. The change is a store-level getter plus swapping a hardcoded\n`null` in the create form, following the existing `Todos.quickCreate()`\nprecedent.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: Make a new link inherit the currently selected category.\n- `src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` — added\n  `getActiveCategoryId(): number | null`, returning `activeFilter` when it is\n  a positive number and `null` otherwise.\n- `src/lib/components/libraries/links/LinkCreate.svelte` — `onsubmit()` now\n  sends `category_id: library.getActiveCategoryId()` instead of a hardcoded\n  `null`.\n- No change to `LinkLibrary.create()`'s signature or the\n  `SaveToLibraryButton.svelte` caller, as required. That caller uses a\n  *separate* `LinkLibrary` instance created in `src/routes/feeds/+layout.svelte`\n  whose `activeFilter` is never set, so `getActiveCategoryId()` stays `null`\n  there and feed saves remain uncategorized.\n\nTASK-2: Add regression tests for the active-category mapping.\n- `tests/unit/stores/LibraryStores.test.ts` — added a `LinkLibrary` test\n  covering all filter states: positive id -> that id, `0` -> `null`,\n  `'favorite'` -> `null`, `null` (All) -> `null`.\n\nTASK-3: Verify the change end to end.\n- `npm run check` — 0 errors, 0 warnings.\n- `npx vitest run tests/unit/stores/LibraryStores.test.ts` — 29 passed.\n- `npm test` — 713/714 passed; the single failure is the pre-existing,\n  unrelated `StatisticWidget > applies the requested color classes` in\n  `tests/components/logic-leaves.test.ts` (untouched by this job).\n- `npm run build` — production build succeeded.\n- `npm run lint` — cannot pass on this branch for pre-existing reasons, see\n  Known issues.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- `npm run lint` fails independently of this change: `prettier --check .`\n  flags 404 files repo-wide (formatting drift, including untouched lines in\n  `LinkCreate.svelte`), and `eslint` reports a pre-existing unused import\n  `CreateLinkCategoryRequest` in `src/lib/state/LinkLibrary.svelte.ts` (line 6,\n  not touched by this job). These are pre-existing and out of scope.\n- No rendered/browser confirmation was possible: the SPA requires a running\n  solyto REST API (`http://localhost:8000`) and authentication, neither of\n  which is available in this environment. The behaviour is covered by the unit\n  tests instead.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":57,"totalLines":57,"truncated":false}},"title":"docs/jobs/punishment_link-library-with-a-category-selected-add-to-that-category/implementation.md","time":{"start":1791376549248,"end":1791376549491}},"id":"prt_1165ce4e3001B34yc3i9z2r11u","sessionID":"ses_ee9a33476ffek46vS2h4uJeqKA","messageID":"msg_1165cdc19001Pj9Ok7EuRXNwul"}}
